image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/firebase-1/PricingLP/Testimonials/ai_stock_avt_MikeSeidl.png","_guests_hp_testimonials_t017_name":"Mike Seidl","_guests_hp_testimonials_t017_role":"Professional Trader","_guests_hp_testimonials_t017_text":"InvestingPro \u003cb\u003egives a clear overview of company health and key fundamental growth curves\u003c/b\u003e, saving me an enormous amount of time as a professional trader.","_guests_hp_testimonials_t038_image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/firebase-1/PricingLP/Testimonials/ai_stock_avt_A%CC%81lvaroLiguori.png","_guests_hp_testimonials_t038_name":"Álvaro Liguori","_guests_hp_testimonials_t038_role":"Financial Education Coach and Trader","_guests_hp_testimonials_t038_text":"I love the Ideas section — it lets me \u003cb\u003esee and compare what Berkshire Hathaway and top funds are investing in\u003c/b\u003e, which is very powerful inspiration for my own decisions.","_guests_hp_testimonials_t073_image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/firebase-1/PricingLP/Testimonials/ai_stock_avt_LaplusradaPensuk.png","_guests_hp_testimonials_t073_name":"Laplusrada Pensuk","_guests_hp_testimonials_t073_role":"CMT, CFTe Technical Analyst, Influencer","_guests_hp_testimonials_t073_text":"\u003cb\u003eThere are so many foreign stocks I'd never discover alone.\u003c/b\u003e InvestingPro bridges that gap with organized investment ideas like curated portfolios from top investors.","_guests_hp_testimonials_t111_image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/firebase-1/PricingLP/Testimonials/ai_stock_avt_SerkanS%CC%A7inik.png","_guests_hp_testimonials_t111_name":"Serkan Şinik","_guests_hp_testimonials_t111_role":"Finance Manager","_guests_hp_testimonials_t111_text":"Using Fair Value, I \u003cb\u003eknew when to sell before a company dropped 40%\u003c/b\u003e — saved me big.","_guests_hp_testimonials_t119_image":"https://storage.googleapis.com/firebase-1/PricingLP/Testimonials/ai_stock_avt_VilasPanditraoDeshmukh.png","_guests_hp_testimonials_t119_name":