renai_charts_limit_title":"Maximum Metrics Reached","_warrenai_charts_metric_search":"Metric Search","_warrenai_charts_metric_search_no_matches":"No matches found","_warrenai_charts_point_labels":"Point labels","_warrenai_charts_quarters":"Quarters","_warrenai_charts_start_y_axis":"Start Y-Axis At 0","_warrenai_charts_supporting_data":"Supporting Data","_warrenai_charts_ticker_limit_title":"You can add up to 7 stocks per chart.","_warrenai_charts_ticker_limit_title_v2":"You can add up to 5 stocks per chart.","_warrenai_charts_title":"Charts \u0026 Supporting Data","_warrenai_context_add_tooltip":"Add context","_warrenai_context_chart_panels":"{{COUNT}} Panels","_warrenai_context_remove":"Remove {{name}}","_warrenai_context_upgrade":"\u003ca\u003eUpgrade\u003c/a\u003e to add Chart context to your WarrenAI chat.","_warrenai_credits_cost":"{{CREDIT_COST}} credits","_warrenai_credits_reset_tooltip":"Your credits renew in {{DAYS}} days ({{DATE}})","_warrenai_hooks_etf_ov_key_stats_prompt_v2":"Are you bullish or bearish on {{SYMBOL_WITH_EXCHANGE}} right now? Analyze its fundamentals (P/E, EPS growth) using key metrics, gather recent relevant news via the news tool, review analyst consensus and price targets, and note any significant technical signals from technical indicators. Share your overall market sentiment on this stock and explain your reasoning.","_warrenai_hooks_etf_ov_key_stats_v2":"{{SYMBOL_OR_SHORT_NAME}} bullish or bearish?","_warrenai_mode_agentic_credits":"2–{{MAX_CREDITS_AMOUNT}} credits* / task","_warrenai_mode_agentic_description":"Deeper multi-step research","_warrenai_mode_agentic_label":"Agentic","_warrenai_mode_analyst_description":"Improved reasoning and accuracy","_warrenai_mode_analyst_label":"Analyst","_warrenai_mode_analyst_tooltip":"New! Try Analyst mode for deeper investment research","_warrenai_mode_credits_disclaimer":"Credits depend on task complexity.","_warrenai_mode_fast_credits":"{{MAX_CREDITS_AMOUNT}} credit / task","_warrenai_mode_fast_description":"Quick answers for simple questions","_warrenai_mode_fast_label":"Fast","_warrenai_mode_original_description":"Quick answers","_warrenai_mode_original_label":"Original","_warrenai_mode_selector_aria_label":"Select chat mode","_warrenai_mode_switch_cancel":"Cancel","_warrenai_mode_switch_close":"Close","_warrenai_remove_from_suggested":"Remove from Suggested","_warrenai_remove_from_watchlist":"Remove from watchlist","_warrenai_sidebar_folders":"Folders","_warrenai_sidebar_guest_empty_text":"\u003cspan {{SIGN_IN}}\u003eSign in\u003c/span\u003e for free to break the silence!","_warrenai_sidebar_guest_empty_title":"Looks a little quiet here...","_warrenai_sidebar_templates":"Templates","_warrenai_sidebar_your_folders":"Your folders","_warrenai_smart_prompt_chip_market_trends":"Market Trends","_warrenai_smart_prompt_chip_market_trends_prompts":"Summarize the latest most important headlines that affect market trends and macro conditions, assess the current market trend and regime using the sentiment, technical summary on leading indices and sector performance. Suggest to dive deeper into any sector in the followup question.","_warrenai_smart_prompt_chip_undervalued_stocks":"Undervalued Stocks","_warrenai_smart_prompt_chip_undervalued_stocks_prompt":"Screen for undervalued stocks using both fundamental metrics and technical indicators. Go through several iterations from screener and content coverage to deeper financial assessment and come up with a shortlist of 5 stocks that are the most likely indeed undervalued by several means, not just one. Present them together in a table highlighting the most important metrics, sector, and upcoming catalysts (from calendar and from reported content coverage) as well as a fundamental chart. Do not present the whole thesis but instead ask whether to dive deeper into any of them.","_warrenai_smart_prompt_chip_upcoming_catalysts":"Upcoming Catalysts","_warrenai_smart_prompt_chip_upcoming_catalysts_prompt":"Scan and search recent content coverage for analysis that flags potential catalysts coming up for stock markets, bonds, crypto and forex each. Including earning events, regulation and policy decisions, central bank rate decisions and meeting minutes, Fed and ECB speeches, inflation and jobs data releases, GDP and PMI prints, treasury auctions, debt ceiling and budget deadlines, tariff and trade announcements, elections, SEC and CFTC rulings, crypto ETF decisions, token unlocks and network upgrades, OPEC meetings, index rebalances, options expiries, everything. Beyond macro, include company-specific and sector-specific catalysts for individual stocks, such as FDA decisions and clinical trial readouts for biotech stocks, crypto-linked stocks reacting to crypto events, product launches, investor days, M\u0026A deals and votes, lockup expirations, IPOs, stock splits, and legal or antitrust rulings. For each event, present its potential impact as described in the coverage, such as which assets, sectors or currency pairs could move, the expected direction, and any scenarios or thresholds analysts highlight. Attribute the impact to the source, and note where sources disagree. Filter out any events that have already passed or occurred.","_warrenai_smart_prompt_title":"What's on your mind today?","_warrenai_suggesting":"Suggesting…","_warrenai_symbol_technical_chart":"{{SYMBOL}} Technical Chart","_warrenai_tier_analyst_credits":"{{MAX_CREDITS_AMOUNT}} credit per task","_warrenai_tier_analyst_description":"Basic reasoning and fast replies","_warrenai_tier_analyst_label":"Analyst","_warrenai_tier_expert_credits":"1–{{MAX_CREDITS_AMOUNT}} credits per task","_warrenai_tier_expert_description":"Longer reasoning and improved accuracy","_warrenai_tier_expert_label":"Senior Analyst","_warrenai_tier_legacy_description":"Legacy mode. Available for existing chats only.","_warrenai_tier_selector_aria_label":"Model tier selector","_warrenai_tour_chip_continue":"Continue tour ({{step}}/{{total}})","_warrenai_tour_chip_dismiss":"Dismiss","_warrenai_tour_chip_start":"Take the Warren 2.0 tour","_warrenai_tour_intro_body":"See WarrenAI research your question step-by-step.","_warrenai_tour_intro_body_bold":"Get answers based on your actual watchlist and charts, not a generic market view.","_warrenai_tour_intro_start":"Take 1-minute tour","_warrenai_tour_intro_title":"WarrenAI Analyst 2.0 is here","_warrenai_tour_step_add_body":"Attach a watchlist or chart so WarrenAI can answer with the right context.","_warrenai_tour_step_add_title":"Add context to your question","_warrenai_tour_step_chart_body":"Draw, switch timeframes, and add indicators. Your chart is automatically added to the conversation context, so you can ask questions about what you see.","_warrenai_tour_step_chart_title":"Your interactive chart","_warrenai_tour_step_memory_body":"Manage your WarrenAI preferences in one place, anytime.","_warrenai_tour_step_memory_title":"Find your settings","_warrenai_tour_step_mode_body":"Analyst gives fast answers. Senior Analyst takes more time for deeper, multi-step research. Your choice applies to the next chat.","_warrenai_tour_step_mode_title":"Asking a harder question?","_warrenai_tour_step_watchlist_body":"Your watchlist is now interactive. Click an item to open its chart right beside the chat.","_warrenai_tour_step_watchlist_title":"Click any instrument","_warrenai_upgrade":"Upgrade","_warrenai_watchlist_add_first_instruments_description":"Add your first instruments and discover new ideas with WarrenAI.","_warrenai_watchlist_caught_up_description":"All suggested stocks were already saved to your watchlist.","_warrenai_watchlist_caught_up_title":"You're all caught up","_warrenai_watchlist_close_chart":"Close chart","_warrenai_watchlist_no_assets_description":"Instruments mentioned by WarrenAI will appear here. You'll be able to view them or save to a watchlist.","_warrenai_watchlist_no_assets_title":"No assets to show","_warrenai_watchlist_open_chart":"Open chart","_warrenai_watchlist_technical_chart_here":"Technical chart, right here","_warrenai_watchlist_technical_chart_here_description":"Click any symbol to see its chart without leaving the page.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory":"Memory","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_add":"Add","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_card_answers_title":"How you want answers","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_card_follow_title":"What you follow","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_chat_hint":"Ask WarrenAI in chat to change what it remembers.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear":"Clear","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear_all":"Clear all memory","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear_all_body":"WarrenAI forgets everything it saved about you. Your chats stay, and it starts again from your next one.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear_all_confirm":"Clear all","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear_all_title":"Clear all memory?","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear_one_body":"Your other memory and your chats stay. If it comes up again, WarrenAI saves it again.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_clear_one_title":"Clear this memory?","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_done":"Done","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_edit":"Edit","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_empty_body":"WarrenAI starts building this from your next few chats.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_empty_title":"Nothing saved yet","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_error_body":"Something went wrong on our side.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_error_clear_all_title":"Your memory was not cleared.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_error_toggle_off_title":"Memory could not be turned off.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_error_toggle_on_title":"Memory could not be turned on.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_free_note_body":"Upgrade and WarrenAI starts learning how you invest.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_free_note_title":"Memory is part of Pro.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_keep_it":"Keep it","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_off_note_body":"Your saved memory is kept, but won't be used or updated.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_off_note_title":"Memory is off.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_save":"Save","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_saved_label":"Saved memory","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_toggle_subtitle":"WarrenAI learns how you invest and uses it in every answer.","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_toggle_title":"Let WarrenAI remember you","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_try_again":"Try again","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_updated_ago":"Updated {{TIME}}","_warrenai_web_settings_memory_upgrade_cta":"Upgrade your plan","_warrenai_web_settings_nav_title":"Settings","_warrenai_web_settings_title":"WarrenAI Settings","_warrenai_why_it_matters":"Why it matters:","_warrenai_workstation_continue_full_screen":"Continue in Full Screen","_wdim_instrument_overview_after_market_down_cta":"Why is {{SYMBOL}} Down After Hours?","_wdim_instrument_overview_after_market_up_cta":"Why is {{SYMBOL}} Up After Hours?","_wdim_instrument_overview_default_down_cta":"Why is {{SYMBOL}} Down Today?","_wdim_instrument_overview_default_up_cta":"Why is {{SYMBOL}} Up Today?","_wdim_instrument_overview_pre_market_down_cta":"Why is {{SYMBOL}} Down in Pre-Market?","_wdim_instrument_overview_pre_market_up_cta":"Why is {{SYMBOL}} Up in Pre-Market?","_wdim_widget_deep_dive":"Deep Dive","_wdim_widget_updated":"Updated {{HOW_LONG_AGO_UPDATED}}","_web_MoreInfo":"More Info","_web_RiskWarning":"Risk Warning","_web_Website":"Website","_web_cross_rates_tool_Etfs_Symbol":"Symbol","_web_cross_rates_tool_fx_Name":"Pair","_web_data_powerd_by":"Data Provided by","_web_fpb_create_account_button":"Create Account","_web_fpb_swap":"Swap","_web_mobile_app_upgrade":"Upgrade","_web_touchActual":"Act","_web_touchForecast":"Cons","_z_to_a":"(Z to A)","_fed_rate_future_price":"Future Price","_fed_rate_meeting_time":"Meeting Time","_fed_rate_monitor_tool_title":"Fed Rate Monitor Tool","GM_MAJOR_ETFS":"Major ETFs","GM_REAL_TIME_FUTURES":"Real Time Futures","GN_DOWNLOAD":"Download","HP_PORTFOLIO":"Portfolio","LOADING_BADGE":"Loading...","RISK_WARNING":"Risk Warning","_earningCal_no_date":"No Earning Reports have been scheduled","_earningCal_periodEnd":"Period End","_earningCal_previous":"Prev.","_ec_currency_short":"Cur.","_ec_currentTime":"Current Time","_ec_event":"Event","_ec_forecast":"Forecast","_ec_importance_short":"Imp.","_ec_no_events_schedualed":"No Events Scheduled","_ec_no_result_found":"No results found","_ec_previous":"Previous","_ec_time":"Time","_eventpage_metadescription":"Get the {{Event_Name}} results in real time as they're announced and see the immediate global market impact.","_eventpage_metatitle":"{{Event_Name}} ({{Event_Currency}}) - Investing.com","_upcoming_release":"Upcoming Release","_commodities_commentary_html_desc":"All relevant comments and discussions regarding {{NAME_TRANS}}.","_commodities_commentary_html_title":"{{NAME_TRANS}} Forum - Investing.com","_commodities_indices":"Commodity Indices","_commodities_overview_front_desc":"Find here information about the {{SHORT_NAME}} ({{SYMBOL}}). \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cb\u003e What Is the {{SHORT_NAME}} Symbol? \u003c/b\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n{{SYMBOL}} is the symbol for {{SHORT_NAME}}. \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cb\u003eWhat Is the Price of {{SHORT_NAME}} Today?\u003c/b\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\nThe {{SHORT_NAME}} price today is {{LAST_PRICE}}.\r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n \u003cb\u003eWhat Stock Exchange Is {{SHORT_NAME}} Traded On?\u003c/b\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n{{SHORT_NAME}} is listed and trades on the {{EXCHANGE}} stock exchange. \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cb\u003e Is {{SHORT_NAME}} a Good Commodity to Buy? \u003c/b\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\nAre you looking to diversify your investment portfolio? Adding commodities could be a smart move. Commodities, like gold, silver, oil, and agricultural products, offer diversification and can hedge against inflation. They move independently of stocks and bonds, spreading risk and providing stability during market fluctuations.\r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e However, investing in commodities comes with risks. Their prices can be volatile, driven by various factors such as supply and demand, geopolitics, and weather conditions. Timing the market is challenging, and without proper research or guidance, investors may face losses. Consultation with a financial advisor can help you make informed decisions and effectively navigate the complexities of the commodity market. \r\n\u003cbr\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\n\u003cb\u003e How To Buy {{SHORT_NAME}} \u003c/b\u003e \r\n\u003cbr\u003e\r\nInvestors can buy {{SHORT_NAME}} through futures contracts, {{SHORT_NAME}} ETFs, or physical ownership. To evaluate its potential, users can sign up to \u003ca href=\"https://www.investing.com/pro/\"\u003eInvestingPro\u003c/a\u003e, where they can assess ETF performance.","_commodities_overview_h1":"{{SHORT_NAME}} ({{CONTRACT_SYMBOL}})","_commodities_overview_html_desc":"Explore real-time {{NAME_TRANS}} price data and key metrics crucial for understanding and navigating the {{NAME_TRANS}} market.","_commodities_overview_html_title":"{{NAME_TRANS}} Price Today - Investing.com","_real_time_commodities":"Real Time Commodities","_invpro_10y_dcf_ebitda_exit":"10Y DCF EBITDA Exit","_invpro_10y_dcf_revenue_exit":"10Y DCF Revenue Exit","_invpro_10y_dcf_terminal_growth_exit":"10Y DCF Terminal Growth Exit","_invpro_5y_dcf_ebitda_exit":"5Y DCF EBITDA Exit","_invpro_5y_dcf_revenue_exit":"5Y DCF Revenue Exit","_invpro_5y_dcf_terminal_growth_exit":"5Y DCF Terminal Growth Exit","_invpro_affo_multiples":"AFFO Multiples","_invpro_cash_flow_health":"Cash Flow Health","_invpro_debt_equity":"Debt / Equity","_invpro_div_yield":"Dividend Yield","_invpro_dividends_multi_stage":"Dividends: Multi-Stage","_invpro_dividends_stable_growth":"Dividends: Stable Growth","_invpro_earnings_power_value":"Earnings Power Value","_invpro_ebitda_multiples":"EBITDA M