:"Export chart data","_tc3_fav_bar_drag":"Drag favorites bar","_tc3_fav_bar_hide":"Hide favorite drawing tools toolbar","_tc3_fav_bar_show":"Show favorite drawing tools toolbar","_tc3_fav_bar_title":"Favorite drawing tools","_tc3_fav_bar_toggle":"Toggle favorite drawing tools toolbar","_tc3_fund_load_error":"Couldn't load the data","_tc3_fund_locked":"InvestingPro","_tc3_fund_no_data":"No data for this stock","_tc3_fund_section":"Fundamentals","_tc3_fund_stocks_only":"Available for stocks","_tc3_fund_stocks_only_body":"Fundamental metrics describe companies. Open a stock's chart to add them.","_tc3_go_to_end":"End","_tc3_go_to_end_before_start":"End must be after start","_tc3_go_to_future_date":"Pick a date that isn't in the future","_tc3_go_to_invalid_date":"Enter a valid date (YYYY-MM-DD)","_tc3_go_to_next_month":"Next month","_tc3_go_to_prev_month":"Previous month","_tc3_go_to_start":"Start","_tc3_go_to_tab_custom_range":"Custom range","_tc3_go_to_tab_date":"Date","_tc3_go_to_title":"Go to","_tc3_hook2_alerts_sign_up_body":"Set a price level and get notified on your phone, by email or on the site, without watching the screen. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook2_alerts_sign_up_feature":"price alerts","_tc3_hook2_analyze_body_subscribe":"Subscribing gives you up to {{count}} AI chart analysis credits so you can see entry, exit and risk/reward for every setup, including trends, key levels and what to watch next.","_tc3_hook2_analyze_body_upgrade":"Upgrading gives you up to {{count}} AI chart analysis credits so you can see entry, exit and risk/reward for every setup, including trends, key levels and what to watch next.","_tc3_hook2_analyze_limit_free":"You’ve reached the limit on your free account for AI chart analysis.","_tc3_hook2_analyze_limit_plan":"You’ve reached the limit on your current plan for AI chart analysis.","_tc3_hook2_analyze_sign_up_body":"Get an instant AI read of the pattern on your screen: trend, key levels, what to watch next. Free credits with an account.","_tc3_hook2_analyze_sign_up_feature":"AI chart analysis","_tc3_hook2_analyze_title":"Analyze more charts with AI before you trade","_tc3_hook2_benefit_charts":"See more charts at once","_tc3_hook2_benefit_export":"Export your data","_tc3_hook2_benefit_indicators":"Room for more indicators on charts","_tc3_hook2_benefit_layouts":"Save more of your setup layouts","_tc3_hook2_charts_body_subscribe":"Subscribing lets you track more charts side by side, each with its own interval and indicators.","_tc3_hook2_charts_body_upgrade":"Upgrading lets you track more charts side by side, each with its own interval and indicators.","_tc3_hook2_charts_limit_free":"You’ve reached the limit on your current free account, which includes {{count}} charts per tab.","_tc3_hook2_charts_limit_plan":"You’ve reached the limit on your current plan, which includes {{count}} charts per tab.","_tc3_hook2_charts_sign_up_body":"View {{count}} charts on one screen, each with its own interval and indicators. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook2_charts_sign_up_feature":"track charts side by side","_tc3_hook2_charts_title":"See up to {{count}} charts on one screen","_tc3_hook2_export_body":"Subscribing lets you download the price, volume and indicator values on your chart as a CSV and run your own analysis. Plans include hourly, 15- and 1-minute bars, depending on the tier.","_tc3_hook2_export_feature":"Export chart data","_tc3_hook2_export_limit":"Data export is not included with a free account.","_tc3_hook2_export_title_feature":"{{feature}} to a spreadsheet","_tc3_hook2_fund_body":"Subscribing unlocks everything on your chart - from Fair Value to Analyst Price Target, financial health and growth metrics, so you can plot them under the price and see whether a company’s numbers back up the move.","_tc3_hook2_fund_history_body":"Upgrading gets you {{count}} years of history on every fundamental, so you can see how a company’s numbers held up across full market cycles, not just recent years.","_tc3_hook2_fund_history_limit":"You’ve reached your plan’s history limit for fundamental metrics.","_tc3_hook2_fund_history_title":"See more history on every fundamental metric","_tc3_hook2_fund_limit":"Want to go beyond standard fundamental indicators? Get more fundamental indicators on your chart.","_tc3_hook2_fund_sign_up_body":"Plot fundamentals like P/E, revenue and EPS right under the price, and see how a company’s numbers move with its stock. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook2_fund_sign_up_feature":"fundamentals on your chart","_tc3_hook2_fund_title":"Add Fair Value and more to your chart","_tc3_hook2_indicators_body_subscribe":"Subscribing lets you build your full setup with unlimited indicators. Combine trend, momentum and volume indicators to confirm a signal from more than one angle before you act.","_tc3_hook2_indicators_body_upgrade":"Upgrading lets you build your full setup with unlimited indicators. Combine trend, momentum and volume indicators to confirm a signal from more than one angle before you act.","_tc3_hook2_indicators_limit_free":"You’ve reached the limit on your current free account, which includes {{count}} indicators per chart.","_tc3_hook2_indicators_limit_plan":"You’ve reached the limit on your current plan, which includes {{count}} indicators per chart.","_tc3_hook2_indicators_sign_up_body":"Run multiple indicators at once, including RSI, MACD and moving averages, to confirm a setup before you trade. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook2_indicators_sign_up_feature":"more indicators","_tc3_hook2_indicators_title":"Run more indicators on one chart","_tc3_hook2_layouts_body_subscribe":"Subscribing lets you keep unlimited saved layouts ready for any setup you follow, with its symbols, indicators and drawings exactly as you left them. Switch setups in one click, on any device.","_tc3_hook2_layouts_body_upgrade":"Upgrading lets you keep unlimited saved layouts ready for any setup you follow, with its symbols, indicators and drawings exactly as you left them. Switch setups in one click, on any device.","_tc3_hook2_layouts_limit_free":"You’ve reached the limit on your current free account, which includes up to {{count}} saved layouts.","_tc3_hook2_layouts_limit_plan":"You’ve reached the limit on your current plan, which includes up to {{count}} saved layouts.","_tc3_hook2_layouts_sign_up_body":"Save your charts with their symbols, indicators, drawings and intervals, and reopen them on any device. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook2_layouts_sign_up_feature":"save your chart layouts","_tc3_hook2_layouts_title":"Save more layouts for multiple setups","_tc3_hook2_sign_up_title_action":"Sign up to {{feature}} for free","_tc3_hook2_sign_up_title_get":"Sign up to get {{feature}} for free","_tc3_hook2_subscribe_now":"Subscribe now","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_body_subscribe":"Subscribing lets you save up to {{count}} custom intervals and switch between them without rebuilding the chart. Just set it once and use it on every symbol.","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_body_upgrade":"Upgrading lets you save up to {{count}} custom intervals and switch between them without rebuilding the chart. Just set it once and use it on every symbol.","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_limit_free":"You’ve reached the limit on your current free account, which includes {{count}} custom timeframe.","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_limit_plan":"You’ve reached the limit on your current plan, which includes {{count}} custom timeframes.","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_sign_up_body":"Go beyond the standard intervals and set one that fits your strategy. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_sign_up_feature":"custom intervals","_tc3_hook2_timeframes_title":"Add up to {{count}} time intervals, one click away","_tc3_hook2_upgrade_now":"Upgrade now","_tc3_hook2_warren_body_subscribe":"Subscribing gets you up to {{count}} WarrenAI credits, for instant answers on any asset in your portfolio, from fundamentals to the latest news. Research as deeply as you need, without rationing your questions.","_tc3_hook2_warren_body_upgrade":"Upgrading gets you up to {{count}} WarrenAI credits, for instant answers on any asset in your portfolio, from fundamentals to the latest news. Research as deeply as you need, without rationing your questions.","_tc3_hook2_warren_limit_free":"You’ve reached the limit on your free account, which includes up to {{count}} credits for WarrenAI.","_tc3_hook2_warren_limit_plan":"You’ve reached the limit on your current plan, which includes up to {{count}} credits for WarrenAI.","_tc3_hook2_warren_sign_up_body":"Ask our AI financial researcher about any asset on your chart, from fundamentals to the latest news, and get answers in seconds. Free welcome credits with an account.","_tc3_hook2_warren_sign_up_feature":"WarrenAI answers","_tc3_hook2_warren_title":"Ask WarrenAI more questions","_tc3_hook2_what_else":"What else you’ll get:","_tc3_hook_sign_up_title":"Sign up to get {{feature}} for free","_tc3_hook_watchlists_sign_up_body":"Save every symbol you follow into unlimited watchlists, synced across devices. Free with an account.","_tc3_hook_watchlists_sign_up_feature":"unlimited watchlists","_tc3_i_param_anchor":"Anchor","_tc3_i_param_anchor_by":"Anchor by","_tc3_i_param_anchor_time":"Anchor time","_tc3_i_param_background":"Background","_tc3_i_param_band_1":"Band 1","_tc3_i_param_band_2":"Band 2","_tc3_i_param_band_3":"Band 3","_tc3_i_param_bands":"Bands","_tc3_i_param_basis_ma":"Basis MA","_tc3_i_param_d_smooth":"D Smooth","_tc3_i_param_deviation":"Deviation %","_tc3_i_param_fast":"Fast","_tc3_i_param_hide_daily":"Hide ≥1D","_tc3_i_param_increment":"Increment","_tc3_i_param_k_smooth":"K Smooth","_tc3_i_param_length":"Length","_tc3_i_param_max":"Max","_tc3_i_param_mult_1":"Mult 1","_tc3_i_param_mult_2":"Mult 2","_tc3_i_param_mult_3":"Mult 3","_tc3_i_param_multiplier":"Multiplier","_tc3_i_param_offset":"Offset","_tc3_i_param_period":"Period","_tc3_i_param_period_1":"Period 1","_tc3_i_param_period_2":"Period 2","_tc3_i_param_peri